1
00:00:00,208 --> 00:00:03,253
Finally, inner peace.

2
00:00:04,295 --> 00:00:05,296
Now what?

3
00:00:17,475 --> 00:00:19,561
Kai, old friend.

4
00:00:21,062 --> 00:00:23,565
Master Oogway.

5
00:00:23,732 --> 00:00:26,860
Our battle ended
500 years ago!

6
00:00:27,277 --> 00:00:29,612
Well, now I'm ready
for a rematch.

7
00:00:29,779 --> 00:00:31,823
Took you long enough!
(LAUGHS)

8
00:00:31,906 --> 00:00:33,158
(GROWLS)

9
00:00:36,578 --> 00:00:38,163
(YELLING)

10
00:00:43,501 --> 00:00:44,502
(GRUNTS)

11
00:00:47,672 --> 00:00:49,716
You've grown stronger.

12
00:00:51,843 --> 00:00:52,844
(GRUNTS)

13
00:00:55,054 --> 00:00:59,767
500 years in the Spirit Realm,
you pick up a thing or two.

14
00:00:59,976 --> 00:01:03,855
I have taken the chi
of every master here.

15
00:01:04,314 --> 00:01:05,315
(GASPS) No!

16
00:01:05,398 --> 00:01:06,399
Yes.

17
00:01:06,483 --> 00:01:09,277
And soon I will have
your power, too.

18
00:01:09,444 --> 00:01:11,362
When will you realize?

19
00:01:11,446 --> 00:01:13,865
The more you take,
the less you have.

20
00:01:16,951 --> 00:01:17,952
(GRUNTS)

21
00:01:23,875 --> 00:01:25,210
(KAI GRUNTING)

22
00:01:34,844 --> 00:01:35,970
With your chi,

23
00:01:36,054 --> 00:01:39,682
I will finally be able
to return to the mortal world.

24
00:01:39,849 --> 00:01:43,853
And this time,
you won't be there
to stop me.

25
00:01:43,937 --> 00:01:44,938
(SIGHS)

26
00:01:45,021 --> 00:01:47,690
It was never my destiny
to stop you.

27
00:01:47,857 --> 00:01:50,944
I have set another
on that path.

28
00:01:56,282 --> 00:01:58,243
Then I will find him,

29
00:01:58,409 --> 00:02:00,995
and take his chi, too.

30
00:02:19,305 --> 00:02:21,683
- Oh, no!
- What's happening?

31
00:02:21,766 --> 00:02:24,269
To your battle stations! Go! Go! Go!

32
00:02:32,986 --> 00:02:34,612
Fire crossbows!

33
00:02:34,696 --> 00:02:36,030
Fire!

34
00:02:38,658 --> 00:02:39,701
Fire!

35
00:02:47,417 --> 00:02:50,086
Tai Lung is free! I must warn Shifu.

36
00:02:50,169 --> 00:02:52,088
You're not going anywhere!
Neither is he!

37
00:02:52,171 --> 00:02:54,007
- Let go of me!
- Bring it up!

38
00:02:56,968 --> 00:02:58,469
Wait! Bring it back!

39
00:03:17,238 --> 00:03:21,242
- He's coming this way!
- He won't get far. Archers!

40
00:04:29,060 --> 00:04:32,271
We're dead. So very, very dead.

41
00:04:32,980 --> 00:04:35,066
Not yet we're not. Now!

42
00:05:22,822 --> 00:05:25,491
- Can we run now?
- Yes.

43
00:05:46,137 --> 00:05:47,513
I'm glad Shifu sent you.

44
00:05:49,807 --> 00:05:52,601
I was beginning to think
I'd been forgotten.

45
00:05:52,685 --> 00:05:54,729
Fly back there and tell them

46
00:05:54,812 --> 00:05:58,524
the real Dragon Warrior
is coming home.

47
00:06:07,074 --> 00:06:10,077
- Tell me what happened that night.
- What night?

48
00:06:10,244 --> 00:06:13,247
- That night.
- Ah, that night.

49
00:06:13,414 --> 00:06:16,417
Yes! We're talking
about the same night, right?

50
00:06:17,334 --> 00:06:21,130
Yes, I was there. Yes. I watched
as your parents abandoned you.

51
00:06:21,297 --> 00:06:25,885
It's a terrible thing.
I believe it went something like this.

52
00:06:36,020 --> 00:06:37,480
Here's your New Year's gift.

53
00:06:37,646 --> 00:06:39,815
Hope you like it,
‘cause you can't return it.

54
00:06:41,692 --> 00:06:44,070
Po? What's he doing here?

55
00:06:44,987 --> 00:06:46,238
Return it! Return it!

56
00:06:58,292 --> 00:07:00,878
Are you willing to die
to find the truth?

57
00:07:01,045 --> 00:07:04,590
You bet I am.
Although I'd prefer not to.

58
00:07:27,363 --> 00:07:29,073
We got them. Go!

59
00:07:50,803 --> 00:07:52,304
You looking for me?

60
00:07:59,311 --> 00:08:01,105
I said that too soon, didn't I?

61
00:08:09,530 --> 00:08:10,698
Pol!

62
00:08:15,452 --> 00:08:16,996
Po, get away from him.

63
00:08:17,162 --> 00:08:19,123
I'll get up. Here we go.

64
00:08:21,917 --> 00:08:24,587
- No more running, Shen.
- So it seems.

65
00:08:24,753 --> 00:08:26,755
Now... answers.

66
00:08:26,922 --> 00:08:29,675
Oh, you want to know so badly.

67
00:08:30,301 --> 00:08:33,512
You think knowing will heal you, huh?

68
00:08:33,679 --> 00:08:37,725
Fill some crater in your soul?

69
00:08:37,891 --> 00:08:40,060
Well, here's your answer.

70
00:08:40,227 --> 00:08:43,314
Your parents didn't love you.

71
00:08:44,356 --> 00:08:46,233
But here...

72
00:08:46,400 --> 00:08:49,069
...let me heal youl!

73
00:08:55,075 --> 00:08:56,869
No!

74
00:09:06,253 --> 00:09:08,213
Wings of Surveillance!

75
00:09:08,380 --> 00:09:09,923
Why do you do that?
Do what?

76
00:09:10,090 --> 00:09:11,717
Just because you say
"Wings of" before something,

77
00:09:11,884 --> 00:09:13,552
it doesn't mean that you're
doing a special move.

78
00:09:13,719 --> 00:09:15,929
It's like me saying
"Antenna of Power"

79
00:09:16,055 --> 00:09:19,266
or "Thorax of
Making Sandwiches."

80
00:09:19,433 --> 00:09:20,726
Wings of Disagreement.

81
00:09:20,893 --> 00:09:22,144
Whoa! There.

82
00:09:23,479 --> 00:09:25,856
CRANE: Master Bear,
Master Chicken, Master Croc!

83
00:09:25,939 --> 00:09:27,149
What are you doing out here?

84
00:09:27,316 --> 00:09:28,984
(CLUCKING) Jade creatures
attacked our villages.

85
00:09:29,109 --> 00:09:30,235
(CLUCKING)
We've tracked them here.

86
00:09:30,402 --> 00:09:31,945
Stop!

87
00:09:34,448 --> 00:09:36,617
They must be in there.

88
00:09:37,076 --> 00:09:38,744
Master Shifu strongly
advised us

89
00:09:38,827 --> 00:09:40,662
(ROARING)

90
00:09:41,455 --> 00:09:42,956
(YELLING)

91
00:09:43,082 --> 00:09:44,333
not to engage.

92
00:09:44,500 --> 00:09:46,001
We've gotta get in there.
But Master Shifu said...

93
00:09:46,168 --> 00:09:47,252
You're seriously afraid?

94
00:09:47,419 --> 00:09:50,297
Even Master Chicken's going
in there! And he's a chicken.

95
00:09:50,464 --> 00:09:51,590
(CLUCKING)

96
00:09:56,970 --> 00:09:58,597
(CLUCKS LOUDLY)

97
00:09:58,680 --> 00:10:00,641
(GASPS) That's it.
I'm going in.

98
00:10:00,766 --> 00:10:02,851
Mantis! We have
orders not to...
They need our help!

99
00:10:02,976 --> 00:10:04,895
Come on.
I'll go high,
you go low.

100
00:10:04,978 --> 00:10:06,021
(WHISPERING) No, wait.

101
00:10:06,772 --> 00:10:08,190
Fear the bug!

102
00:10:08,357 --> 00:10:09,858
All right, you little...

103
00:10:09,983 --> 00:10:10,984
Uh-oh!

104
00:10:11,110 --> 00:10:12,194
Hold on, buddy. I'm coming!

105
00:10:12,361 --> 00:10:14,780
Antenna of Power!
Ah! It didn't work!

106
00:10:14,947 --> 00:10:15,989
Mantis!

107
00:10:20,869 --> 00:10:22,121
Mantis?

108
00:10:23,330 --> 00:10:25,290
(WHISPERING) Mantis.

109
00:10:25,999 --> 00:10:27,000
(GASPS)

110
00:10:29,670 --> 00:10:31,505
(WHISTLING)

111
00:10:31,672 --> 00:10:33,674
(GRUNTING)

112
00:10:34,883 --> 00:10:36,051
(SNORTS)

113
00:10:37,344 --> 00:10:39,179
Your chi is strong.

114
00:10:39,847 --> 00:10:41,181
Just like your friend,

115
00:10:42,182 --> 00:10:43,350
the bug.

116
00:10:43,809 --> 00:10:45,352
(GASPS) Mantis.

117
00:10:47,145 --> 00:10:49,022
(CRANE SCREAMING)

118
00:10:51,149 --> 00:10:52,985
He wasn't just a student.

119
00:10:57,322 --> 00:11:00,158
Shifu found him as a cub

120
00:11:01,785 --> 00:11:04,705
and he raised him as his son.

121
00:11:07,082 --> 00:11:10,168
And when the boy showed
talent in kung fu,

122
00:11:11,253 --> 00:11:13,505
Shifu trained him.

123
00:11:13,589 --> 00:11:17,718
He believed in him. He told him
he was destined for greatness.

124
00:11:19,428 --> 00:11:21,179
It was never enough for Tai Lung.

125
00:11:23,890 --> 00:11:25,517
He wanted the Dragon Scroll.

126
00:11:26,101 --> 00:11:30,397
But Oogway saw darkness
in his heart and refused.

127
00:11:30,731 --> 00:11:34,443
Outraged, Tai Lung
laid waste to the valley.

128
00:11:36,903 --> 00:11:38,947
He tried to take the scroll by force.

129
00:11:39,031 --> 00:11:43,619
And Shifu had to destroy
what he had created.

130
00:11:44,911 --> 00:11:46,496
But how could he?

131
00:12:00,719 --> 00:12:04,890
Shifu loved Tai Lung
like he had never loved anyone before.

132
00:12:13,106 --> 00:12:14,399
Or since.

133
00:12:19,946 --> 00:12:22,240
This battle is between you and me.

134
00:12:23,617 --> 00:12:26,745
So, that is how it's going to be.

135
00:12:26,828 --> 00:12:28,872
That is how it must be.

136
00:12:43,303 --> 00:12:47,849
I rotted in jail for 20 years
because of your weakness!

137
00:12:47,933 --> 00:12:50,310
Obeying your master is not weakness!

138
00:12:50,394 --> 00:12:53,188
You knew I was the Dragon Warrior.

139
00:12:53,271 --> 00:12:55,399
You always knew.

140
00:12:55,482 --> 00:13:00,487
But when Oogway said otherwise,
what did you do?

141
00:13:01,613 --> 00:13:04,157
What did you do?

142
00:13:06,618 --> 00:13:07,702
Nothing!

143
00:13:07,786 --> 00:13:10,622
You were not meant to be the Dragon
Warrior! That was not my fault!

144
00:13:10,705 --> 00:13:12,457
Not your fault?

145
00:13:12,541 --> 00:13:14,668
Who filled my head with dreams?

146
00:13:14,751 --> 00:13:17,087
Who drove me to train
until my bones cracked?

147
00:13:17,170 --> 00:13:19,923
Who denied me my destiny?

148
00:13:29,141 --> 00:13:31,768
It was never my decision to make!

149
00:13:37,232 --> 00:13:38,525
It is now.

150
00:13:44,072 --> 00:13:47,159
Give me the scroll!

151
00:13:47,242 --> 00:13:48,493
I would rather die.

152
00:14:38,877 --> 00:14:42,005
All I ever did, I did to make you proud!

153
00:14:42,172 --> 00:14:44,674
Tell me how proud you are, Shiful

154
00:14:45,634 --> 00:14:47,135
Tell me!

155
00:14:47,677 --> 00:14:49,387
Tell me!

156
00:14:59,689 --> 00:15:03,068
I have...
I have always been proud of you.

157
00:15:04,194 --> 00:15:07,489
From the first moment, I've been

158
00:15:07,572 --> 00:15:09,866
proud of you.

159
00:15:09,949 --> 00:15:12,327
And it was my pride

160
00:15:12,410 --> 00:15:14,412
that blinded me.

161
00:15:14,496 --> 00:15:18,083
I loved you too much
to see what you were becoming,

162
00:15:19,084 --> 00:15:21,336
what I

163
00:15:21,419 --> 00:15:23,421
was turning you into.

164
00:15:24,214 --> 00:15:26,174
I'm...

165
00:15:26,257 --> 00:15:27,258
I'm sorry.

166
00:15:35,767 --> 00:15:38,478
I don't want your apology.

167
00:15:38,561 --> 00:15:40,105
I want my scroll!

168
00:15:42,190 --> 00:15:44,192
What?

169
00:15:44,275 --> 00:15:45,485
Where is it?

170
00:15:46,820 --> 00:15:51,449
Dragon Warrior has taken the scroll
halfway across China by now.

171
00:15:52,575 --> 00:15:55,703
You will never see that scroll, Tai Lung.

172
00:15:55,787 --> 00:15:57,122
Never.

173
00:15:58,039 --> 00:15:59,040
Never.

174
00:16:07,757 --> 00:16:09,759
The only way out is up.

175
00:16:10,468 --> 00:16:11,886
What?

176
00:16:22,897 --> 00:16:25,775
Follow me! Come on!

177
00:16:25,942 --> 00:16:27,277
Where are they going?

178
00:16:27,444 --> 00:16:30,280
- To the top!
- Come on! Keep going!

179
00:16:37,537 --> 00:16:39,080
Here we go!

180
00:16:57,765 --> 00:17:01,102
- You idiot!
- My nose!

181
00:17:01,269 --> 00:17:05,690
Call in the wolves! All of them!
I want them ready to move!

182
00:17:05,857 --> 00:17:09,485
The Year of the Peacock begins now!

183
00:17:09,652 --> 00:17:12,530
Right now?
‘Cause it's the middle of the year,

184
00:17:12,697 --> 00:17:15,366
so you'd only get like
a half of the Year of the Peacock.

185
00:17:17,160 --> 00:17:20,288
And this is the Year, of course,
of the Peacock.

186
00:17:20,455 --> 00:17:22,457
Happy New Year, sir.

187
00:17:26,294 --> 00:17:30,548
Get the wolves ready.
We're loading the ships now.

188
00:17:30,715 --> 00:17:31,799
Now!

189
00:17:31,966 --> 00:17:33,885
Now, now, now, now, now!

190
00:17:34,052 --> 00:17:36,846
Move! Move, move, move, move!

191
00:17:53,237 --> 00:17:54,864
This way.

192
00:17:59,243 --> 00:18:01,079
Let's go.

193
00:18:25,478 --> 00:18:26,688
Fire!

194
00:18:31,734 --> 00:18:33,569
Inner peace.

195
00:19:01,055 --> 00:19:02,056
Again!

196
00:19:09,397 --> 00:19:10,398
Yeah!

197
00:19:11,691 --> 00:19:14,652
Kill him! Somebody kill him!

198
00:19:36,841 --> 00:19:39,260
What? No. No!

199
00:19:45,892 --> 00:19:48,895
Keep firing! Keep firing!

200
00:20:09,540 --> 00:20:11,042
Skadoosh.

201
00:20:41,280 --> 00:20:42,615
How did you...?

202
00:20:44,033 --> 00:20:45,660
How did you do it?

203
00:20:49,622 --> 00:20:52,124
You know, you just keep your elbows up
and keep the shoulders loose.

204
00:20:52,291 --> 00:20:55,461
Not that. How did you find peace?

205
00:20:55,628 --> 00:20:59,298
I took away your parents. Everything.

206
00:20:59,465 --> 00:21:01,842
I scarred you for life.

207
00:21:02,468 --> 00:21:05,972
See, that's the thing, Shen.
Scars heal.

208
00:21:06,138 --> 00:21:10,142
No, they don't. Wounds heal.

209
00:21:10,309 --> 00:21:12,728
Oh, yeah. What do scars do?
They fade, I guess?

210
00:21:12,895 --> 00:21:17,316
- I don't care what scars do.
- You should, Shen.

211
00:21:17,483 --> 00:21:21,404
You gotta let go of that stuff from
the past, 'cause it just doesn't matter.

212
00:21:21,570 --> 00:21:26,075
The only thing that matters
is what you choose to be now.

213
00:21:26,242 --> 00:21:27,660
You're right.

214
00:21:27,827 --> 00:21:30,204
Then I choose... this!

215
00:22:23,007 --> 00:22:25,217
That was pretty hard-core.

216
00:22:27,678 --> 00:22:28,763
Oh, you wanna spare me?

217
00:22:28,929 --> 00:22:31,098
How about you spare me
the chit-chat?

218
00:22:31,223 --> 00:22:33,058
All right? Let's do this.

219
00:22:33,225 --> 00:22:35,186
I'm going to take your chi,

220
00:22:35,352 --> 00:22:38,022
then the chi
of every panda in the...

221
00:22:38,105 --> 00:22:39,273
Oh! Chit-chat!

222
00:22:39,440 --> 00:22:40,900
In this...
Chitty-chitty chat-chat.

223
00:22:41,066 --> 00:22:42,359
In...
Chat, chat, chat.

224
00:22:43,110 --> 00:22:44,361
In the...
Chit-chat!

225
00:22:44,445 --> 00:22:47,114
Oh, you pudgy little...
(GROWLS)

226
00:22:51,619 --> 00:22:53,412
Round them all up.

227
00:23:07,092 --> 00:23:09,136
(GASPS) Oh, no. It's true.

228
00:23:09,303 --> 00:23:11,263
You guys have all been
turned green!

229
00:23:11,430 --> 00:23:14,308
Except for you, Mantis.
You were already green.

230
00:23:16,393 --> 00:23:17,603
Now?
Wait for the signal.

231
00:23:18,395 --> 00:23:19,396
(YELLS)

232
00:23:20,272 --> 00:23:21,398
Here we go!

233
00:23:24,443 --> 00:23:25,444
(SNORTS)

234
00:23:32,326 --> 00:23:33,452
Dumpling Squad!

235
00:23:33,619 --> 00:23:35,329
Ready?
Go time!

236
00:23:35,496 --> 00:23:37,164
Belly!
Gong!

237
00:23:38,332 --> 00:23:39,333
BOTH: Whoo!

238
00:23:40,834 --> 00:23:41,835
Seriously?

239
00:23:41,919 --> 00:23:42,962
Yeah! Whoo!
We did it! Whoo-hoo!

240
00:23:44,171 --> 00:23:45,422
Sorry, Crane.

241
00:23:45,589 --> 00:23:46,590
(CLUCKS)

242
00:23:46,924 --> 00:23:47,925
(LAUGHS)

243
00:23:48,926 --> 00:23:49,927
(GRUNTS)

244
00:23:50,094 --> 00:23:51,095
(YELPS)

245
00:23:53,430 --> 00:23:56,016
Spring Roll Squad!
Time for some takeout!

246
00:23:56,517 --> 00:23:57,518
(ALL GRUNTING)

247
00:24:00,854 --> 00:24:01,855
(CLUCKS)

248
00:24:02,856 --> 00:24:04,525
(ALL CHEERING)
PO: Yoo-hoo!

249
00:24:04,858 --> 00:24:06,360
Over here, Mr. Jombie!

250
00:24:10,864 --> 00:24:11,865
(LAUGHING)

251
00:24:12,116 --> 00:24:13,993
I don't know who
you are, either.

252
00:24:14,368 --> 00:24:15,369
Noodle Squad!

253
00:24:18,872 --> 00:24:20,624
Get ready to dance

254
00:24:20,791 --> 00:24:22,292
with danger!

255
00:24:22,376 --> 00:24:23,377
(YELLS)

256
00:24:26,380 --> 00:24:27,548
Oh, sweet!

257
00:24:32,219 --> 00:24:33,554
(EXCLAIMING IN DISBELIEF)

258
00:24:39,476 --> 00:24:40,561
Stripy Baby!

259
00:24:40,728 --> 00:24:41,729
(GASPS) Oh.

260
00:24:41,854 --> 00:24:42,855
Whee!

261
00:24:42,980 --> 00:24:44,148
(GRUNTING)

262
00:24:44,314 --> 00:24:45,524
(GIGGLING)

263
00:24:46,191 --> 00:24:47,860
Do it.
You're mean!

264
00:24:53,741 --> 00:24:54,992
BAO: Fire!

265
00:24:57,870 --> 00:25:00,080
(GROWLING)

266
00:25:00,664 --> 00:25:01,749
BAO: Fire in the hole!

267
00:25:01,915 --> 00:25:03,000
Oh!

268
00:25:03,250 --> 00:25:04,334
Yes!

269
00:25:04,418 --> 00:25:06,086
All right, kids!

270
00:25:06,253 --> 00:25:07,588
You got it, guys!

271
00:25:11,383 --> 00:25:12,676
Oh, no! Master Shifu!

272
00:25:14,511 --> 00:25:15,512
I can't hit Shifu!

273
00:25:17,723 --> 00:25:18,766
I can!

274
00:25:18,932 --> 00:25:20,601
And so can I.

275
00:25:22,394 --> 00:25:23,937
BOTH: Double-Dad Defense!

276
00:25:24,188 --> 00:25:25,355
Left, Dad!
Right, Dad!

277
00:25:25,522 --> 00:25:26,523
Thanks, Dad!

278
00:25:26,690 --> 00:25:27,900
Back at you, Dad.

279
00:25:28,066 --> 00:25:29,610
We've got this, son!

280
00:25:30,444 --> 00:25:31,528
(LAUGHS) Go, Dads!

281
00:25:31,695 --> 00:25:32,696
LI: Yeah!

282
00:25:36,116 --> 00:25:37,618
Yeah! (LAUGHS)

283
00:25:37,743 --> 00:25:38,786
We got them now.

284
00:25:38,869 --> 00:25:41,789
(SNORTS) Stop. Stop! Enough!

285
00:25:43,957 --> 00:25:45,083
Get out...

286
00:25:46,794 --> 00:25:47,795
(LAUGHING)

287
00:25:47,878 --> 00:25:48,879
(GASPS)

288
00:25:49,213 --> 00:25:50,589
Let's finish this.

289
00:25:52,716 --> 00:25:53,717
BOTH: That's our boy!

290
00:25:57,304 --> 00:25:58,305
(GRUNTS)

291
00:26:09,399 --> 00:26:12,319
Sorry, buddy. Gotta send you
back to the Spirit Realm.

292
00:26:12,486 --> 00:26:13,570
Skadoosh!

293
00:26:15,656 --> 00:26:18,575
Okay, that didn't work.
Let me try one more time.

294
00:26:18,742 --> 00:26:22,329
Skadoosh! Skadoosh. Skadoosh.
Skadoo... What the...

295
00:26:22,496 --> 00:26:24,414
Hold on, wait!
It's working.

296
00:26:24,581 --> 00:26:26,500
No. No!

297
00:26:26,625 --> 00:26:28,460
(IMITATING CHOKING)

298
00:26:29,586 --> 00:26:31,171
(LAUGHING)

299
00:26:31,296 --> 00:26:33,423
No, it's not.

300
00:26:33,590 --> 00:26:35,259
Did Oogway teach you
that little trick?

301
00:26:35,926 --> 00:26:37,135
Too bad.

302
00:26:37,302 --> 00:26:39,346
It only works on mortals.

303
00:26:39,513 --> 00:26:43,433
And I am a Spirit Warrior.

